  "limitations": [
    "Both saved headings are zero degrees. The footprint calculation uses the general oriented-body geometry, but this native journey independently proves the observed straight-heading exit and does not establish oblique-heading cases.",
    "Persisted RPM is 800 rather than zero after exit. The ordinary idle/parked autonomy step calls VehicleKinematics::stop(), which assigns the 800 RPM idle value. All post-exit snapshots retain zero vehicle motion and exactly unchanged fuel/odometer. Evidence therefore claims parked zero motion/fuel use, not a persisted engine-off RPM state.",
    "Snapshots are separated by active simulation time. The after-drive to after-exit interval includes additional physical movement and fuel use before the parked checkpoint; these exports cannot attribute that interval to the ExitVehicle transaction itself.",
    "Whole-world JSON is not expected to remain identical during continued simulation. Avatar needs and world time progress; the listed owner, pose and parked-vehicle invariants remain exact."
